#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-AD0078 expect=skipped domain=ADSL
#note "DISCRIMINATING (the sheet's own carve-out). The single-period study: TRT01P is the ONLY column matching either pattern and the _wildcards xx.min=2 filter drops it, TRTSDT matches nothing, so the anchor set is empty -> NoMatch -> the rule does not execute. This is what 'when there is only 1 Treatment Period 01, TRTSDT is sufficient' compiles to. If this fires, the min filter is not being applied - escalate."
#library standard=adamig version=1-3
dataset ADSL structure=ADSL
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col TRT01P  type=Char
col TRTSDT  type=Num
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | PLACEBO | 21915
